# Reviewed manifest of Cloud Run SERVICE IDs (lowercase, as deployed in
# asia-south1, autodeck-studio) whose backing Firebase callable is INTENDED to
# be publicly invocable (roles/run.invoker on allUsers) because customer/admin
# devices call them over HTTPS and authenticate inside the function with a
# Firebase ID token. Service IDs are the lowercase Cloud Run names, NOT the
# camelCase function export names - the API 404s on camelCase.
# Add a service ONLY with an explicit reviewer sign-off. Services NOT listed
# here are not asserted private by the checker - they are simply not checked.
# Incident 2026-11-01: these 5 were first-deployed without the binding.
createmyprotection
updatemyprotection
removemyvehicleimage
removemylistingphoto
replacemylistingphoto
recordwebvital
# Incident 2026-11-03: getPickupQuote first-deployed without the binding
# (run-level 403); requestPickupDrop is the sibling public callable and is
# asserted here so the checker covers the whole pickup/drop ingress.
getpickupquote
requestpickupdrop
# Incident 2026-11-07: recoverManagedCataloguePublish first-deployed without
# the binding (run-level 401); binding applied live per owner approval.
recovermanagedcataloguepublish
